WEBVTT

00:15:27.198 --> 00:15:30.622
to inspire young people,

00:15:30.646 --> 00:15:32.043
another generation.

00:15:33.543 --> 00:15:36.906
And when I looked out
and saw that sea of humanity,

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:39.241
I said to myself, "This is it.

00:15:39.265 --> 00:15:40.856
I must go forward."

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:42.907
I tell you,

00:15:42.931 --> 00:15:47.540
it came together and we worked,
all of us, very hard

00:15:47.564 --> 00:15:52.131
on getting the Lord's cry out
on the Mall that day.

00:15:52.155 --> 00:15:53.874
But it went so well,

00:15:53.898 --> 00:15:56.398
the president, President Kennedy,

00:15:57.255 --> 00:16:00.319
invited us down to the White House
after the march was over,